      "long_description": "<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The Student Council will co-design Your Education, Your Voice&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">You will collaborate with the GovLab team to:</span></p>\n<ol>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Offer feedback on design of each of the citizen engagement initiatives.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Provide advice and feedback on content to ensure that materials are engaging and clear.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Present results to leaders in philanthropy, government and education.</span></li>\n</ol>",
      "short_description": "An organizing committee of students advising on, designing and running the program.",
